  "extract_html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"ib-wrap\" style=\"width:360px\">\n   \n<aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-silver pi-layout-default\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"Box title\">Psi-Leech Energy Manipulation</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\" data-source=\"image\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/1/10/Psionic_Leeching.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20170606022201\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"Psionic Leeching\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/1/10/Psionic_Leeching.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/516?cb=20170606022201\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/1/10/Psionic_Leeching.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/516?cb=20170606022201 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/1/10/Psionic_Leeching.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/1032?cb=20170606022201 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"Psionic Leeching\" width=\"270\" height=\"261\" data-image-key=\"Psionic_Leeching.jpg\" data-image-name=\"Psionic Leeching.jpg\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Darkstar (Valiant Entertainment) is a disembodied mental parasite sharing his power with a host in order to harvest psychic energy.</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Row 1 info\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Power/Ability to:</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Manipulate parasitic psychic energy.</div>\n</div>\n</aside>\n</div>\n<p>The power to <b>manipulate parasitic psychic energy</b>.  Combination of <a href=\"/wiki/Psychic_Energy_Manipulation\" title=\"Psychic Energy Manipulation\">Psychic Energy Manipulation</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Parasitic_Energy_Manipulation\" title=\"Parasitic Energy Manipulation\">Parasitic Energy Manipulation</a>.\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Also_Called\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Also Called</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Capabilities\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Capabilities</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Applications\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Applications</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Techniques\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Techniques</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Associations\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Associations</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Limitations\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Limitations</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Known_Users\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Known Users</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Also_Called\">Also Called</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FPsi-Leech_Energy_Manipulation%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D1&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>Mental Energy Hunger</li>\n<li>Psionic Vampirism</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Capabilities\">Capabilities</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FPsi-Leech_Energy_Manipulation%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D2&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The user can create, shape and manipulate psionic energy of a parasitic nature which drains neural, emotional, mental, spiritual or life energies.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Applications\">Applications</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FPsi-Leech_Energy_Manipulation%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D3&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Anti-Psychic_Presence\" title=\"Anti-Psychic Presence\">Anti-Psychic Presence</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Cultivation\" title=\"Cultivation\">Cultivation</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Mental_Assimilation\" title=\"Mental Assimilation\">Mental Assimilation</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Psychic_Aura\" title=\"Psychic Aura\">Psi-Leech Aura</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Psychic_Constructs\" title=\"Psychic Constructs\">Psi-Leech Constructs</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Psionic_Tendril_Generation\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Psionic Tendril Generation\">Psionic Tendril Generation</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Energy_Attacks\" title=\"Energy Attacks\">Psi-Leech Energy Attacks</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Energy_Generation\" title=\"Energy Generation\">Psi-Leech Energy Generation</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Energy_Propulsion\" title=\"Energy Propulsion\">Psi-Leech Energy Propulsion</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Psi_Vampirism\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Psi Vampirism\">Psi Vampirism</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Neuronal_Vampirism\" title=\"Neuronal Vampirism\">Neuronal Vampirism</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Psychic_Energy_Absorption\" title=\"Psychic Energy Absorption\">Psychic Energy Absorption</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Psionic_Drain\" title=\"Psionic Drain\">Psionic Drain</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Techniques\">Techniques</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FPsi-Leech_Energy_Manipulation%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26sect